; INVALID: a mip-chain whose level count cannot fit the lowering budget.
;
; The chain expands eight forms per generated level. A u32-max count would ask
; for four billion name slots, so the hook refuses at the texture's
; `:mip-level-count` before any allocation — a located lowerer-budget refusal,
; not a host OutOfMemory. (The mutation sweep found this case.)

(texture :name mipTex :size [64 64] :format rgba8unorm
  :mip-level-count 4294967295 :usage [texture-binding render-attachment])
(mip-chain :name fillMips :texture mipTex)
